  Uses typed GDScript declarations for web-export safety.
- Anti-stuck progress timer (same speed-based architecture as Auditor)

Multi-model guide: docs/multi-model-guide.md
Smoke tests: tests/auditor_anti_stuck_test.gd, tests/claim_jumper_anti_stuck_test.gd

